    {
      "key": "tb95ea4b4ee9a7ff4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is copy trading?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是跟单交易？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td5d7ea507a456dc2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is copy trading profitable?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">跟单交易有利可图吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t64c79d85242e18e1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Copy trading can produce gains or losses. Profitability depends on the provider, market conditions, costs, risk settings, and execution. A profitable historical record is not reliable evidence that future copied trades will remain profitable.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">跟单交易可以产生收益或损失。盈利能力取决于提供商、市场条件、成本、风险设置和执行。盈利的历史记录并不能证明未来复制交易仍能盈利。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t65ea041f10f8cf97",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is copy trading the same as social trading?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">跟单交易与社交交易相同吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0c91ff1a92e49340",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Copy trading is not covered by one simple yes-or-no rule for every service. Legality and availability depend on the provider, activity, jurisdiction, and licence. UAE users should verify the regulated entity and permitted service before depositing or subscribing.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">跟单交易的合法性无法用一个简单的“是”或“否”规则概括所有服务。是否合法及是否可用，取决于提供商、业务活动、司法管辖区和许可证。阿联酋用户在入金或订阅前应核实受监管的实体及其获准提供的服务。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t50741d2c29bcc944",
