    },
    {
      "key": "t529d94d27d721324",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Market Maker Broker?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是做市商经纪商？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta06344a6b9d8c9ba",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A market maker broker provides bid and ask prices and may act as the contractual counterparty to a client’s trade.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">做市商经纪商提供买入价和卖出价，并可以充当客户交易的合同对手方。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tba01388b71574f6b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market-maker accounts often use spread-only pricing. Spreads may be fixed or variable and can widen when volatility increases or liquidity falls.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">做市商账户通常使用仅点差定价。点差可能是固定的或可变的，并且当波动性增加或流动性下降时可能会扩大。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2fa05e466a2a7b6a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market Maker Broker</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">做市商经纪商</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td7b2668edf0bd030",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Broker-provided bid and ask quotes</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">经纪商提供的出价和要价</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0841a9ddc1b6a287",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Counterparty</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">交易对手</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t537f2447d1e0b73f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Orders may use external liquidity; the legal CFD counterparty may still be the broker</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">订单可能会使用外部流动性；合法的差价合约交易对手可能仍然是经纪商</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t60e0972a19ab8414",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Spread type</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">点差类型</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdfd0e2e9b92b47b5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Often spread-only; fixed or variable</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">通常仅通过点差收费；点差可固定或浮动</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tddb75f4101f384c1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Usually variable and may be raw or near-raw</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">通常是可变的，可能是原始的或接近原始的</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5aa56b2b2d36224b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Frequently no separate commission</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">通常没有单独的佣金</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tab01a457af4a6fbf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Often charges commission, markup or both</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">通常收取佣金、加价或两者兼而有之</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6cecfb2503db90e5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">May be higher for commission-based tiers</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">基于佣金的层级可能会更高</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1be6288ee3043bdc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Best suited for</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">最适合</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tcbda12164b78b3f4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Dealing-desk conflict may be reduced, but execution risks remain</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/ecn-vs-market-maker-broker-difference"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">交易台冲突可能会减少，但执行风险仍然存在</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t71875be7df9e780f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Execution</span>",
